#. な、何よ…
#. 私のどこが間違っているっていうのよ…
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? You think s-something I said is wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…
#. 私のどこが間違っているっていうのよ…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? You think s-something I said is wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>被害者は超高校級の軍人で…
#. 戦場を渡り歩いていた…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The victim was the Ultimate Soldier, who'd strolled\n"
"across a thousand battlefields...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで…全身に傷を受けていた…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that how she got all those wounds...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの死体にある全身の傷は、
#. 戦場で受けた傷なんかじゃなかったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, those wounds didn't come from the battlefield.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女について書かれた<CLT><CLT 3>資料<CLT><CLT 4>を見れば、
#. それがハッキリするはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One look at <CLT><CLT 3>what was written<CLT><CLT 4> about her and that\n"
"should become clear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
